keletal demineralization. These effects underscore the need for proactive monitoring of bone health and vitamin D/calcium supplementation in chronic users [Data: Relationships (15809, 15816, 17721); Entities (17414, 17604, 17721)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Neurological and cognitive side effects are prominent with 苯妥英钠 exposure\",\n            \"explanation\": \"苯妥英钠 is associated with central nervous system adverse effects including '发语障碍' (speech disorders), '恍惚' (confusion), and '意识损害' (impaired consciousness). These symptoms are often dose-dependent and exacerbated by elevated free drug concentrations, particularly in the context of drug interactions (e.g., with isoniazid or fluconazole) that inhibit its metabolism. A reported case describes a CYP2C9 rapid metabolizer who developed severe neurotoxicity after co-administration with fluconazole, with serum levels more than double the therapeutic range, illustrating the narrow therapeutic window and susceptibility to interaction-induced toxicity [Data: Relationships (15771, 15785, 15788); Entities (15634, 16117, 16146)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Cardiac conduction disturbances represent a critical safety concern\",\n            \"explanation\": \"At high concentrations, 苯妥英钠 can cause serious cardiac conduction abnormalities, including '窦停搏' (sinus arrest) and atrioventricular block. These effects are particularly dangerous when 苯妥英钠 is used in combination with other agents that suppress sinoatrial node function, such as amiodarone, potentially leading to complete heart block or cardiac arrest. Although 苯妥英钠 is sometimes used to treat digitalis-induced arrhythmias, its pro-arrhythmic potential in overdose or interaction scenarios demands careful ECG monitoring and serum level assessment [Data: Relationships (15800); Entities (16695, 18074)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"An anomalous indication for gynecological infections raises data qu